  "description": "The Axiom Fabric library provides a standardized Azure Service Bus-based communication system for distributed .NET applications.\n      It enables modules to register with a central fabric, report health status, handle commands, and communicate across environments with built-in isolation and cross-talk prevention.\n      Supports both module integration and dashboard monitoring scenarios.",
