  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-beta1:\n      - Initial beta release\n      - Module client integration with health reporting and command handling\n      - Dashboard client for monitoring and control\n      - Cross-communication prevention with fabric/environment/tenant isolation\n      - Automatic heartbeat and health reporting\n      - Service Bus provisioning support\n      - Comprehensive validation and security features",
